{"id":"terrible","lemma":"terrible","pos":"adj","rank":626,"glosses":["terrible, awful, horrible (very bad)","appalling (shocking, causing consternation)","terrific (very great or intense)"],"ipa":"/teˈrible/","forms":{"femininePlural":"terribles"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodrigo5260-terrible.wav","examples":[{"text":"¡Oh! Eso es terrible.","en":"Oh! That's too bad.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/734380"},{"text":"Tengo unos dolores terribles.","en":"I have a terrible pain.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/458975"},{"text":"¿Acaso es tan terrible?","en":"Is that so terrible?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449537"},{"text":"He tomado algunas decisiones terribles.","en":"I've made some terrible decisions.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/768248"},{"text":"El pago es terrible.","en":"The pay is terrible.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800211"}]}